      "comment": "Adjust the pH to 6.6-6.8. The medium should be dispensed into sterile 16x125 screw cap tubes. Fill the tubes to about 1/8 of an inch from the top. Autoclave at 121ºC"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": "Note: Media may be dispensed aseptically to avoid boil over. If not, I would recommend using rubber screw caps."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "comment": "Combine Solutions 2 and 3. Adjust the pH to 6.6-6.8. The medium should be dispensed into sterile 16x125 screw cap tubes. Fill the tubes to about 1/8 of an inch from the top. Autoclave @ 121C."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "comment": "Note: Media may be dispensed aseptically to avoid boil over. If not, I would recommend using rubber screw caps."
    },
