      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "comment": "This may be added by the bacteriologist."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "comment": "Gas under N2. Dispense into Hungate tubes or bottles. Generally 4-5 test tubes (8-10ml each is sufficient). Autoclave @ 121C"
    },
